 "caption": "AFL clubs barely share sponsors.\n\nWe counted the current partners at 17 AFL clubs: 615 partner slots, 466 different brands. 403 of those brands back one club only. That is 86%.\n\nThe ones that do spread are drinks. Gatorade is at 15 clubs, Cool Ridge at 14 and Pepsi Max at 11.\n\nThis is our database, not the whole market. Read the full story: link in bio\n\n#sportsbusiness #sponsorship #sportsmarketing #partnerships"
